{"id":"c3d353f164230c6a","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity.md","title":"有限子句体保证后果算子连续","display":"thm-definite-herbrand-continuity — 有限子句体保证后果算子连续","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity","aliases":["72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity"],"display":"thm-definite-herbrand-continuity — 有限子句体保证后果算子连续","depends_on":["[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]","[[72-df-scott-continuity]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local finitary proof for the positive fragment of Ch.IX §§2.6–3.3","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-definite-herbrand-continuity — 有限子句体保证后果算子连续"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3a4858795b9c601\" href=\"?note=f3a4858795b9c601\" title=\"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator\">72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b5b4d9209f24056\" href=\"?note=6b5b4d9209f24056\" title=\"72-df-scott-continuity\">72-df-scott-continuity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local finitary proof for the positive fragment of Ch.IX §§2.6–3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,P,T_P\">\\(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,P,T_P\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3a4858795b9c601\" href=\"?note=f3a4858795b9c601\" title=\"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator\">72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D:=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathcal D:=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq:=\\{\\langle I,J\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D^2:I\\subseteq J\\}\">\\(\\preceq:=\\{\\langle I,J\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D^2:I\\subseteq J\\}\\)</span>，底为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D\\)</span> 非空且按包含关系有向；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Scott}\">\\(\\operatorname{Scott}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b5b4d9209f24056\" href=\"?note=6b5b4d9209f24056\" title=\"72-df-scott-continuity\">72-df-scott-continuity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPO}(\\mathcal D,\\preceq,\\varnothing)\\land\\operatorname{Scott}_{\\mathcal D,\\preceq}(T_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PCPO}(\\mathcal D,\\preceq,\\varnothing)\\land\\operatorname{Scott}_{\\mathcal D,\\preceq}(T_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_P\\!\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\right)=\\bigcup_{I\\in\\mathcal A}T_P(I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_P\\!\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\right)=\\bigcup_{I\\in\\mathcal A}T_P(I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含关系上的幂集是完全格，有向上确界为并。单调性由所有体原子属于输入的条件立即得到。若头在左侧，存在一条有限体闭实例，其每个体原子在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal A\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal A\\)</span> 中；有向性逐个合并有限多个这样的集合，得到同一成员包含全部体原子，故头在右侧。空体时任取非空族的一个成员。逆包含由单调性。关键是每条体有限，而不是Herbrand基或闭实例集合有限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","status":"resolved","id":"f3a4858795b9c601","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-scott-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-scott-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","status":"resolved","id":"f3a4858795b9c601","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,P,T_P$ 取 [[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]；$\\mathcal D:=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)$，$\\preceq:=\\{\\langle I,J\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D^2:I\\subseteq J\\}$，底为 $\\varnothing$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-scott-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D$ 非空且按包含关系有向；$\\operatorname{Scott}$ 使用 [[72-df-scott-continuity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,P,T_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D:=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq:=\\{\\langle I,J\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D^2:I\\subseteq J\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Scott}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPO}(\\mathcal D,\\preceq,\\varnothing)\\land\\operatorname{Scott}_{\\mathcal D,\\preceq}(T_P).","display":true},{"tex":"T_P\\!\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\right)=\\bigcup_{I\\in\\mathcal A}T_P(I).","display":true},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal A","display":false}],"bytes":1874,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity|thm-definite-herbrand-continuity — 有限子句体保证后果算子连续]]"},{"id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["f3a4858795b9c601","6b5b4d9209f24056"]}